            "text": "<p>SnoRail™ and SnoFence™ offer a timeless, architecturally refined snow retention system specifically designed for copper standing seam and batten seam roofs. Crafted from brass components and mechanically attached without soldering, these systems preserve both the performance and aesthetics of traditional copper roofing. Whether for historic renovations or new copper roofing projects, SnoRail™ and SnoFence™ provide lasting protection against dangerous rooftop avalanches — all while maintaining the clean lines and beauty of the roof.</p>",
